source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Connect Marginalia: its address, and a personal token from its Account page, Connected apps. The token is read from standard input (or asked for), checked with Marginalia, then kept in the secrets file

Usage: mxr reading marginalia connect [OPTIONS] --url <URL>

Options:
      --url <URL>          Marginalia's address, such as `https://reader.example.com`
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
